  contentsAnswer: Camera gear for a property survey. It includes a stabilizer; I
    have the travel checklist.
  weightAnswer: Thirteen kilos, case included. I weighed it before leaving.
  metalAnswer: Brackets, lenses, the usual. Not a case full of metal.
  packingAnswer: Battery removed. Transport pin fitted. The moving stage is locked
    solid.
  responseAnswer: Foam can tremble, but that locked stage cannot pull back after
    a push.
  authorReasoning: 'Carrier: 12.9 kg and moderate metal fit. The explicit locked/unpowered
    explanation contradicts a clear delayed corrective pulse. Same broad response
    as innocent case 08, different packing claim.'
